# Multibyte text: . and multis count characters, not bytes.

=== . matches one multibyte character
ref:    pattern.txt *pattern-multibyte*
quote:  Patterns will also work with multibyte characters, mostly as you would expect.
given:  |aéc
keys:   :s/a.c/(&)/<CR>
expect: |(aéc)

=== . matches one CJK character
ref:    pattern.txt *pattern-multibyte*
quote:  Patterns will also work with multibyte characters, mostly as you would expect.
given:  |漢字x
keys:   :s/漢./(&)/<CR>
expect: |(漢字)x

=== \{n} counts characters
ref:    pattern.txt *pattern-multibyte*
quote:  Patterns will also work with multibyte characters, mostly as you would expect.
given:  |漢字かな
keys:   :s/.\{3}/(&)/<CR>
expect: |(漢字か)な

=== a collection holds multibyte characters
ref:    pattern.txt */[]*
quote:  [А-яЁё]		Russian alphabet (with utf-8 and cp1251)
given:  |Ёж z
keys:   :s/[А-яЁё]\+/(&)/<CR>
expect: |(Ёж) z

=== [^] matches a multibyte character
ref:    pattern.txt *E944*
quote:  "\"[^xyz]\" matches anything but 'x', 'y' and 'z'."
given:  |x漢y
keys:   :s/[^xy]/(&)/g<CR>
expect: |x(漢)y

=== \S\+ spans CJK characters
ref:    pattern.txt */\S*
quote:  non-whitespace character; opposite of \s
given:  |漢字 かな
keys:   :s/\S\+/(&)/g<CR>
expect: |(漢字) (かな)

=== \< finds a word boundary between CJK and ASCII
ref:    pattern.txt */\<*
quote:  Matches the beginning of a word: The next char is the first char of a word.
given:  |漢字abc
keys:   :s/\<a/(&)/<CR>
expect: |漢字(a)bc

=== \a does not match a multibyte letter
ref:    pattern.txt */\P*
quote:  NOTE: the above also work for multibyte characters.  The ones below only match ASCII characters, as indicated by the range.
given:  |éa
keys:   :s/\a/(&)/g<CR>
expect: |é(a)

=== \%u matches a CJK character
ref:    pattern.txt */\%d*
quote:  Matches the character specified with up to four hexadecimal characters.
given:  |a漢b
keys:   :s/\%u6f22/(&)/<CR>
expect: |a(漢)b

=== a search lands on a CJK character
ref:    pattern.txt */*
quote:  Search forward for the [count]'th occurrence of {pattern} |exclusive|.
given:  |漢字 漢字
keys:   /字<CR>
expect: 漢|字 漢字
